---
import { resolveAsset } from '../utils/streaming';
const logoSrc = resolveAsset('/assets/twice-logo.svg');
const base = (import.meta.env.BASE_URL || '/').replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="footer-top-grid">
      <div class="footer-brand-col">
        <div class="brand footer-brand">
          <span class="brand-seal" aria-hidden="true">
            <img src={logoSrc} alt="" width="26" height="29" class="brand-logo-img" />
          </span>
          <span class="brand-copy">
            Once Upon a Timeline
            <small>TWICE FAN ARCHIVE · 2015–2025</small>
          </span>
        </div>
        <p class="footer-tagline">
          Archivo visual interactivo dedicado a las 9 integrantes de TWICE, su música y sus personajes oficiales.
        </p>
        <div class="footer-status-pill">
          <span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span>10 Años · One in a Million</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-links-col">
        <h4 class="footer-heading">Exploración</h4>
        <nav class="footer-nav" aria-label="Navegación del archivo">
          <a href={`${base}/`}>01 · Inicio &amp; Integrantes</a>
          <a href={`${base}/#personajes`}>02 · Personajes (Lovelys &amp; Tdoongz)</a>
          <a href={`${base}/musica`}>03 · Música, Eras &amp; MVs</a>
        </nav>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-links-col">
        <h4 class="footer-heading">Experiencias</h4>
        <nav class="footer-nav" aria-label="Experiencias interactivas">
          <a href={`${base}/giras`}>04 · Giras &amp; Hall of Fame</a>
          <a href={`${base}/fan-zone`}>05 · ONCE Fan Zone</a>
          <a href={`${base}/moda`}>06 · Moda Escénica</a>
        </nav>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-links-col">
        <h4 class="footer-heading">Enlaces Oficiales</h4>
        <nav class="footer-nav" aria-label="Enlaces oficiales de TWICE">
          <a href="https://twice.jype.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
            <span>JYP TWICE Oficial</span>
            <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17L17 7M7 7h10v10"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a href="https://www.twicejapan.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
            <span>TWICE Japan</span>
            <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17L17 7M7 7h10v10"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a href="https://jypj-store.com/collections/twice-lovelys" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
            <span>Tienda JYP Lovelys</span>
            <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17L17 7M7 7h10v10"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@TWICE" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
            <span>YouTube Oficial</span>
            <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17L17 7M7 7h10v10"/></svg>
          </a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-bottom-row">
      <p class="disclaimer">
        Sitio de fans no oficial sin fines de lucro. Desarrollado con Astro 7. TWICE, su música, composiciones, logotipos y personajes Lovelys y TDOONGZ pertenecen a JYP Entertainment y sus respectivos titulares.
      </p>
      <div class="footer-badges">
        <span class="badge-once">
          <span>MADE WITH</span>
          <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M12 21.35l-1.45-1.32C5.4 15.36 2 12.28 2 8.5 2 5.42 4.42 3 7.5 3c1.74 0 3.41.81 4.5 2.09C13.09 3.81 14.76 3 16.5 3 19.58 3 22 5.42 22 8.5c0 3.78-3.4 6.86-8.55 11.54L12 21.35z"/>
          </svg>
          <span>FOR ONCE</span>
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
